{"id":"consultant-fees","title":"What permit consultants say clients paid them","question":"How much money changes hands to get permits through?","finding":"Across 462 quarterly reports that could be read, 46 permit consultants and firms reported $6.7 million in fees from clients for permit consulting.","how":"The 'amount of compensation' boxes on each quarterly Form 3410B filed with the Ethics Commission, summed by the consultant's employer. Only forms with a readable text layer are counted; an amended report replaces the original, and the same client and amount reported by two consultants at one firm for the same quarter is counted once.","limits":"This is disclosed income for a registered trade. The total is a floor: paper filings that were scanned cannot be read, forms list only the first clients unless extra sheets are attached, and people who help with permits without registering do not file at all. Several filers write that they have 'no projects over $1 million' to report, which suggests the duty to report covers only large projects; the rule itself should confirm that. Law firms report fees for land-use work that goes beyond permits.","tier":"OFFICIAL","columns":[{"k":"firm","t":"Consultant or firm","type":"org"},{"k":"reported","t":"Client fees reported","type":"usd"},{"k":"clients","t":"Clients named","type":"int"},{"k":"filings","t":"Quarterly reports read","type":"int"},{"k":"years","t":"Years","type":"text"}],"rows":[{"firm":"Farella Braun + Martel LLP","reported":1566326,"clients":46,"filings":32,"years":"2018–2025"},{"firm":"Dale Durrett","reported":1496551,"clients":32,"filings":32,"years":"2018–2026"},{"firm":"Reuben, Junius & Rose, LLP","reported":829184,"clients":216,"filings":146,"years":"2018–2026"},{"firm":"Jules Mancilla Inc","reported":497925,"clients":35,"filings":25,"years":"2019–2026"},{"firm":"Cyndi Batson","reported":416100,"clients":9,"filings":17,"years":"2019–2026"},{"firm":"A.R. Sanchez-Corea & Associates, Inc.","reported":322658,"c